% Evidence against an exception, derived by a rule.
% The exception injured(a) has positive support 0.6; the vet rule derives
% evidence against it with confidence 0.58. gk subtracts the opposing
% support on the exception atom before the exception can block the
% default, so the default is blocked with strength 0.6 - 0.58 = 0.02 and
% flies(a) is reported with confidence 0.98 -- the same value the fact
% 0.58::-injured(a) would give.
bird(a).
0.6::injured(a).
vet(a).
0.58::-injured(X) :- vet(X).
flies(X) :- bird(X), unless(injured(X), 2).
query(flies(a)).
